{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39310","headline":"鄠杜旧居二首 一 · 韦庄","name":"鄠杜旧居二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"却到山阳事事非，谷云谿鸟尚相依。\n阮咸贫去田园尽，向秀归来父老稀。\n秋雨几家红稻熟，野塘何处锦鳞肥？\n年年爲献东堂策，长是芦花别钓矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}